66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, the on-site team covers the rollout, but I need to know if they support the older yard scanners. If they only know the new software, the floor still stops.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, the on-site team is a band-aid. If the core is still aging on our racks, we are just paying for a faster breakdown.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the core rot is real, but the people are the bottleneck. D’s presence ensures the supervisors actually keep the new steps.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
