70,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I understand the fear of rot. But A’s regional team offers a single point of contact. That solves the ownership gap I found.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, A’s regional team is remote. If the yard scanners fail, they cannot fix the hardware. D’s engineers are physically present.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, presence is nice, but A’s fixed configuration prevents the drift I saw. It forces a stable core, not a patchwork of aging parts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
